sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as Chat Widget UI
    participant Router as Chatbot Router
    participant Schemas as Pydantic Schemas
    participant Service as Chatbot Service
    participant Memory as Conversation Memory
    participant Prompt as System Prompt
    participant Gemini as Gemini API
    participant Fallback as Fallback Engine

    User->>UI: Type question + optional context
    UI->>Router: HTTP POST /chat ChatRequest JSON
    Router->>Schemas: Validate request schema
    Schemas-->>Router: Validated ChatRequest
    Router->>Service: chat message, conversation_id, context

    Service->>Service: Generate or reuse conversation_id UUID

    Service->>Service: If context provided build enhanced message

    Service->>Service: is_available check GEMINI_API_KEY + model

    alt Gemini API Available
        Service->>Memory: build_gemini_history conversation_id
        Memory-->>Service: Gemini-formatted history role, parts

        Service->>Gemini: Configure API key Create GenerativeModel
        Service->>Gemini: start_chat history send_message enhanced_message
        Gemini-->>Service: AI Response Text

        alt Quota Error 429
            Service->>Service: Try fallback model gemini-2.0-flash-lite
            Service->>Gemini: Create new GenerativeModel Retry send_message
            Gemini-->>Service: Fallback Model Response
            Service->>Service: Update active model name
        else No Quota Error
            Service->>Service: Use primary model response
        end

        Service->>Memory: add_message conv_id user original_message
        Service->>Memory: add_message conv_id assistant ai_response

        Service-->>Router: success True message ai_response conversation_id model_used

    else Gemini API Unavailable
        Service->>Fallback: match_fallback_topic message
        Fallback->>Fallback: Scan keywords ic50 recommend preprocess model general
        Fallback-->>Service: Pre-defined response with disclaimer

        Service->>Memory: add_message conv_id user original_message
        Service->>Memory: add_message conv_id assistant fallback_response

        Service-->>Router: success True message fallback_response conversation_id model_used fallback
    end

    Router-->>UI: HTTP 200 ChatResponse JSON
    UI-->>User: Display AI response in chat widget